Rembrandt - a paint program for Oberon pictures, and the documents of pictures

  Desktops.OpenDoc Rembrandt.Panel     the tools: pens, colours, selections, flip, rotate, scale
  Desktops.OpenDoc picture.Pict        a picture in a document; also .gif, .xbm, .pbm and the
                                       other formats of the section Documents of Oberon.Text
  RembrandtDocs.Open name              the same
  Rembrandt.Undo, Rembrandt.Redo       in the panel
